    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a bit of a broad brushstroke. Can you get a bit more specific on the \"hands-on management\" part for Sub-Saharan Africa and SE Asia? I'm trying to figure out if it's more about skill gaps or if there's an inherent difference in how the workers approach discipline and following strict protocols compared to the Eastern European teams.",
